---
title: "team_assign_member (Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: check authenticated session
    q_auth --> q_error_unauth: session invalid
    q_auth --> q_check_admin: session valid
    q_check_admin --> q_error_forbidden: user is not admin
    q_check_admin --> q_validate: user is admin
    q_validate --> q_check_team: validate team_id and member_id exist
    q_check_team --> q_error_not_found: team or member not found
    q_check_team --> q_check_deleted: both exist
    q_check_deleted --> q_error_deleted: member is logically deleted
    q_check_deleted --> q_assign: member is active
    q_assign --> [*]: update member team assignment via SQL, return success
    q_error_unauth --> [*]: return unauthorized error
    q_error_forbidden --> [*]: return forbidden error
    q_error_not_found --> [*]: return not found error
    q_error_deleted --> [*]: return error deleted member

    note right of q_check_admin
        INV-001: Only admin users can assign members to teams
    end note

    note right of q_check_deleted
        INV-002: Logically deleted members must not be assigned to teams
    end note
